WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:06.768
Yimɓe nder ɓerɗe maɓɓe ɗon ngi'a yamɗitugo, ɓe ɗon ɗaɓɓa ɓikkoy maɓɓe, ɓe ngaɗata ko wooɗi.

00:00:06.848 --> 00:00:09.402
Yimɓe ɗon njaha haa le'i bee dokke.

00:00:09.482 --> 00:00:13.993
Ɓe mbi'i to ɓe ɓadake ngam jaɓugo ɓe, ɓe nanii ko ɓe mbi'ata.

00:00:14.073 --> 00:00:19.938
To ɓe njooɗoto nder ɓerɗe maɓɓe, ɓe warataa ɓaawo maajum, ɓe ɓeyda ɓernde go'o.
